Serverdata/

# Logged and derived data — stays local, never pushed.
# These are rebuilt from the replay/log archive by tools/serverdata/*.py and
# mil_sim/*.py, so git carries the CODE that produces them and not the output.
# analysis/ also held 365 real player Steam IDs joined to skill ratings, which
# is data people generated by playing on the server rather than by agreeing to
# publish it. It was removed from history on 2026-08-12, not merely untracked.
analysis/
Screenshots/
